<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT WESTERN AUSTRALIA BY ONE WICKET.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT WESTERN AUSTRALIA BY ONE WICKET.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat Western</p>
<p>Australia by one wicket in a one-day match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Western Australia 235-6 (50 overs); West Indies</p>
<p>237-9 (49.4 overs).</p>
</text>
